{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Cut for Stories 是一款專為 Instagram 限時動態而設的編輯工具，讓你匯入相片後套用多款模板，輕鬆做出與別不同的動態內容。無論是日常分享生活點滴，還是想為社交平台增添個人風格，都能快速完成。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多款模板與字體隨心配搭</h2>\n<p>匯入相片後，可自由放入各種限時動態模板，做出寶麗來、舊相機等熱門效果。內置編輯工具讓你快速調整亮度與對比度，亦可自製背景漸變並以滴管吸取相片色調。想加入想法、字幕或金句，多款字體與顏色任你選擇，更支援多段字幕。一按即可裁剪相片並套用模糊或純色背景，完成後可儲存或直接發佈至 Instagram 限時動態。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1151-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1152-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1153-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1154-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1155-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1156-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cut for Stories</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T06:58:29.810725+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}